<title>USA: Bankers Trust issues $150 mln debt due 2011.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust issues $150 mln debt due 2011.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Bankers Trust New York Corp was priced on Thursday, according a Bankers Trust syndicate source.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANKERS TRUST NEW YORK CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	  COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/11</p>
<p>TYPE SUB NOTES	ISS PRICE 99.184  FIRST PAY DATE 4/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A3	 YIELD 7.341 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS    SPREAD 82 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTES PRICED OVER U.S. TREASURY 10-YEAR NOTE</p>
<p>-- U.S. corporate bond unit 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
